<Layout title="Privacy" description="How Burrito handles contact enquiries, website hosting, and links to other services. We do not use advertising trackers or marketing cookies."><PageIntro eyebrow="Burrito DAO" title="Privacy" /><section class="wrap page-content"><div class="prose"><p>This website does not use advertising trackers, analytics scripts, or marketing cookies. Images are served with the site.</p><h2>Contacting us</h2><p>The contact form prepares an email on your device. It does not submit your details to a website database. If you send the email, we receive the information you choose to share and use it to respond to your enquiry.</p><h2>Other platforms</h2><p>Links to Discord, X, Spotify, and marketplaces take you to services with their own privacy policies. No social feeds or media players are loaded here automatically.</p><h2>Hosting</h2><p>Our hosting provider may process basic request information, such as IP address and browser information, to deliver and protect the website.</p><p>For questions, contact <a href="mailto:contact@burritodao.com">contact@burritodao.com</a>.</p></div></section></Layout>
